# caption: Lift a nonescaping direct-call group with propagated capture requirements.

REQUIRE resolved local function group, known direct calls, no escaping function values
ENSURE lifted definitions and calls preserving lexical bindings
collect each body's immediate free-variable requirements
propagate callee capture requirements to callers until stable
choose deterministic added-parameter order for each lifted function
move definitions and rewrite captured references to added parameters
rewrite every call to supply its callee's required lexical values
verify no former local binding remains free

